Sub-Category

The data currently stored beneath Category stays exactly where it is and becomes Sub-Category data.

Therefore:

CURRENT:

Total | [blank] | Store | Six-Digit SKU | Product | Tax Code | Store Number | Common Name | Category | Date 1 | Price 1 | Date 2 | Price 2 ...

NEW:

Total | [blank] | Store | Six-Digit SKU | Product | Tax Code | Store Number | Common Name | Sub-Category | Date 1 | Price 1 | Date 2 | Price 2 ...

The physical positions MUST remain unchanged.

Conceptually:

A = Total
B = blank
C = Store
D = Six-Digit SKU
E = Product
F = Tax Code
